Third-party components
----------------------
KitePlayer decodes media through KiteCodec (https://github.com/yuroyami/KiteCodec),
a separate Apache-2.0 project, consumed as a dependency and not vendored into
this repository. KiteCodec in turn links against FFmpeg's libav* libraries
(https://ffmpeg.org), licensed under the LGPL-2.1-or-later (or the GPL when
built with --enable-gpl). FFmpeg is NOT covered by this NOTICE or by
KitePlayer's Apache-2.0 license, and neither is KiteCodec's own NOTICE.

Depending on the FFmpeg build flavour a consumer links, the linked FFmpeg may
additionally bundle third-party codec and rendering libraries (SVT-AV1,
libvpx, libaom, libopus, libmp3lame, libwebp, FreeType, HarfBuzz, FriBidi,
libass, x264/x265 in the GPL flavour, and others), each under its own
license. The complete component list, per-component licenses, and the
distribution obligations they carry are documented at:
https://yuroyami.github.io/KiteCodec/licensing/
(source: docs/licensing.md in the KiteCodec repository).
